           f"On hindsight: the documentation shows that the channel exists by construction (daily totals on a 12 UTC gauge day spread over the hours by Stage IV's hourly shape, so an hour before midnight can carry a factor set by a day that includes rain after the issue time), but on {a7['n_days']} test-year days (the builder's 50 plus 28 I chose by onsets and night storms, which hold 11.8 mm of Stage IV rain after midnight on average against 1.1 mm in the builder's) the AORC rain before midnight does not depend on the Stage IV rain after it "
