    what="independent recomputation of the headline numbers, the clock of the three AORC windows, the saved networks, the AORC series (fetcher and cache), the derived blocks of the results file, the figure and, as the main question, the hindsight risk of code/16_aorc_rain_to_midnight.py (experiment E1b: the E1 design with NOAA AORC v1.1 hourly rain, 1 km, basin mean over the CAMELS outline, in place of ERA5), with the reviewer's own code; the engine (flood.load_preds, thresholds, evaluate, LSTMNet, Run.predict, load_data), features.py and camels.py were used as the brief allowed",
